---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="Ramjan Khandelwal: building systems, thinking across domains." activeNav="about">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="about-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I'm Ramjan.
      </p>
      <p>
        I like building things, usually because I run into something I want to understand or a problem I want
        to solve. RepSheet came from forgetting competitive programming patterns. Pixel-Flow came from wanting
        to experiment with node-based AI image processing. This digital garden came from wanting my notes and
        ideas to connect instead of disappearing into separate files.
      </p>
      <p>
        I work mostly around ML, systems, embedded software, and competitive programming, but I'm interested
        in whatever makes me curious. I like understanding how things work underneath and then trying to build
        something with that understanding.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is a place for that. Technical writing, things I've built, things I'm learning, and thoughts
        that don't quite fit anywhere else.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of computers, I play guitar, I'm learning to surf and do calisthenics, and I'd like to write a
        book someday.
      </p>
      <p>
        If something here interests you, reach me at <a href="mailto:ramjankhandelwal7@gmail.com">ramjankhandelwal7@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-header { padding-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
</style>
